OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy in the evening and overnight
OL,7,Fwith fresh northwest winds and showery
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain. A few clearer
OL,9,Fspells possible towards Orkney and
OL,10,Fwinds beginning to ease.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FVariable cloud and bright
OL,13,Fspells with a few showers in the
OL,14,Fmorning, becoming dry and bright
OL,15,Fthrough the afternoon. Outbreaks of
OL,16,Frain, some heavy, spread east in the
OL,17,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
