OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FBreezy with occasionally heavy rain or
OL,7,Fshowers on Thursday. Bright spells and
OL,8,Fshowers on Friday rain spreading east
OL,9,Flater. Bright spells and blustery
OL,10,Fshowers on Saturday.
